{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 5, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct", "content": "Dear Team\n\nI hope this message finds you well and thriving in your current endeavors. I am writing to extend a formal invitation to all of you to attend an important gathering that we have scheduled to take place next week. This meeting is designed to bring together the key contributors who have been instrumental in shaping our recent initiatives and to ensure that we remain aligned as we move forward into the next phase of our project.\n\nOver the past several months we have seen remarkable progress across multiple departments. Your dedication and insight have not gone unnoticed. The data we have collected shows clear patterns that are highly correlated with the strategies we have implemented. These correlations are not coincidental. They reflect the thoughtful planning and consistent execution that each of you has brought to the table. We believe that this is a pivotal moment to pause reflect and celebrate what we have accomplished together.\n\nWe are also aware that many of you have been experiencing unique challenges during this period. Whether it is balancing workload managing deadlines or adapting to new tools and systems your resilience has been extraordinary. This meeting is not just about reviewing metrics or discussing deliverables. It is about creating a space where your experiences are honored and your voices are heard. We want to understand what has been working what has been difficult and what ideas you have for improvement.\n\nThe meeting will be held on Wednesday of next week at 1000 AM in the main conference room on the fifth floor. We have reserved the space for two full hours to allow for open dialogue and collaborative discussion. Light refreshments will be provided and we encourage you to come with an open mind and a willingness to share. If you are unable to attend in person please let us know as soon as possible. A virtual link will be made available for those who are working remotely or traveling.\n\nDuring the session we will begin with a brief overview of the outcomes we have achieved so far. We will then move into a roundtable format where each participant will have the opportunity to speak about their perspective. There will be no formal presentations. Instead we will focus on conversation and connection. We will also introduce a new framework that we believe will help us better align our efforts moving forward. This framework is built on the insights you have already shared with us and it is designed to be flexible adaptable and responsive to your needs.\n\nWe are not just asking for your time. We are asking for your trust. We believe that when people feel seen heard and valued they produce their best work. We are committed to creating an environment where that is not just a goal but a reality. If you have any suggestions for topics you would like to see included in the discussion please reply to this email by Monday evening. Your input will directly shape the agenda.\n\nThank you for all that you do. Your energy your creativity and your perseverance are the driving forces behind our success. We are truly grateful to have you as part of this journey. Please confirm your attendance by Friday so we can prepare accordingly. We look forward to seeing you there and to building something even greater together.\n\nWarm regards  \nAlex Morgan  \nProject Lead  \nInnovation & Strategy Division  \nGlobal Solutions Group", "logprobs": [{"token": "Dear", "logprob": -0.038177624344825745}, {"token": " Team", "logprob": -0.2168251872062683}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.031858257949352264}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.012486261315643787}, {"token": " hope", "logprob": -0.011078985407948494}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -6.663577369181439e-05}, {"token": " message", "logprob": -2.1457441107486375e-05}, {"token": " finds", "logprob": -1.2874520507466514e-05}, {"token": " you", "logprob":